// CLAIM: Anything that runs on the page but not in your document
// HOLDS: absent
// TERMS: directive lifecycle mounted unmounted plugin middleware hook
// WHY: "there is no X at all" cannot be probed by writing one X — a probe naming `onMounted` misses
//      `mounted`, and both miss `useEffect`. So this asserts that star DECLARES none of these terms.
//      Prose mentioning one is fine; a declaration is not, which is the distinction that keeps the
//      gate from firing on its own explanation.
